BARBAAD KARBALA MAIN HUWA FATIMA KA GHAR<br>
<br>
 EK DOPAHER MAIN KAISA BHARA GHAR UJAD GAYA,<br>
 BHAYI SE BHAYI BAAP SE BETA BICHHAD GAYA,<br>
 BAAD-E-HUSSAIN HOGAYI ZAINAB BA REHNA SAR<br>
<br>
KHAA KAR SINA JO ABKAR-E-MEHROO GUZAR GAYE,<br>
 MAADAR KE KHWAB TOOTH KE PAL MAIN BIKHAR GAYE,<br>
 GHAM MAIN JAWA PISAR KE NA PHAT JAYE AB JIGAR<br>
<br>
SUKHA GALA WO TEER-E-SITAM WA MUSIBATAA,<br>
 DASHT-E- ATASH MAIN GHUNCHA DAHAN KA THA HAUSLA,<br>
 AUR USS PA MUSKURANA JAWABAN WO TEER PAR<br>
<br>
SHAADI BHI ISS TARAAH KI NA DEKHI GAYI KAHIN,<br>
 MEHMAAN NAWAZI KE LIYE PANI BHI AB NAHI,<br>
 LAASHA HASAN KE LAAL KA HAI KHOO MAIN TAR BA TAR<br>
<br>
JAB BAAD-E-ASR RAN MAIN KATA SHAH HA KA GALLA,<br>
 TAREEQ AANDHIYOU SE HUWA DASHT-E-KARBALA,<br>
 DEKHA TAVEEL NAIZE PA ZAINAB NE SHEH KA SAR<br>
<br>
KHAIME HAIN SHOLA POOSH NIGHEBAAN AB NAHI,<br>
 AHLE-E-HARAM KI ASS KA SAMAAN AB NAHI,<br>
 MAIDAN MEIN BIBIYA SABHI BAITHI HAIN KHAAK PAR<br>
<br>
NAHANNI SI JAAN PA KAISI QAYAMAT GUZAR GAYI,<br>
 RUQSAR NILGUN HAIN TOH GARDAN BANDHI HUI,<br>
 KAANO KE KHOON SE PHATA KURTA HAI TAR BA TAR,<br>
<br>
 AHL-E-HARAM KO RASSI MAIN LAAYE HAIN BANDH KAR,<br>
 KYA BEKASI BARASTI HAIN AAL-E-RASOOL PAR,<br>
 PAISHE-E-YAZID ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR HAIN NANGE SAR<br>
<br>
TOUQ-E-GARAAN MEIN ABID-E-BIMAAR ALLAMA,<br>
 WO TEZZ DHOOP DURROU SE AAZAAR ALLAMA,<br>
 SHUKRE-E-KHUDA SOHAIL THA UNKI ZUBAAN PAR..